  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Not fueled by some independent emotion or habit, the cat simply purrs harder. Somehow.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> 3 purring feats.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> This feat doesn’t grant a new purring option and instead is treated as possessing 1 additional purring feat when determining your purring abilities (including range, number of simultaneous purrs, etc.).</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat may be selected multiple times.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/purring-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
